WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Choose the PSD folder, then set paper width, spacing and rotation.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.500
Photoshop reads the artwork and the software generates layout options.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Once the files are ready, choose the balanced layout.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.500
Open the preview and inspect artwork and canvas boundaries.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Confirm the layout, then export CMYK TIFF.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Open the exported file and check the dimensions and layout.
